    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Features</h2></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Various Cute Bugs Fighting in the Arena\u3011</h2>Cute bugs is ready to fight! Do not underestimate them because of their adorable appearance for each one of them has the its special skills. For example, Yippo, a timid and shy boy would carry a gun to snipe his opponents in the dark once he is in the arena; Rocco, bare handed, who loves martial arts since he was a child, would intimidate his opponents with his powerful moves; Lee is middle aged but still defiant, and loves to fight with a stick. With such a group of insects gathered in the forest, the match is undoubtedly be wonderful!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/3cc3739cde5df4c1d88b7c5980a7da82.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/3cc3739cde5df4c1d88b7c5980a7da82.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/3cc3739cde5df4c1d88b7c5980a7da82.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Turn-based Action on Chessboards, New Wargame Fun\u3011</h2>Relive the classic wargame fun from childhood! In addition to the turn-based action, random map elements, and the strategy of wargaming, the game will also add a shrinking &quot;safe area&quot;  mechanism to speed up the game pace and stimulate more Highlights moments. The new wargame battles with deep strategy are coming, are you ready to experience the mind-blowing dramatic fun?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/7d3f9670e76776f5f29e0696c52cf56e.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/7d3f9670e76776f5f29e0696c52cf56e.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/7d3f9670e76776f5f29e0696c52cf56e.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Random Arena Scene with Over 100 Strategies Combinations \u3011</h2>Randomly generated arena enables over a hundred different strategies! The game is full of various Roguelike elements such as random hexagon tiles (grass, snow, water, etc.) , on top of which different obstacles or hidden elements will be randomly generated, and a few treasure chests awaits being mined! Even if your opponent is currently the advantageous party in the match, the random events such as Rainfall will disrupt the current rhythm of the battle and may benefit you, so let's bring the strongest brain and heart and turns the table!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/efa76037dba3d152f8cb64dd97cfc955.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/efa76037dba3d152f8cb64dd97cfc955.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Get Started in Three Minutes, Five Minutes to Reach the Climax\u3011</h2>Strategy is more important than fancy operations! No complicated finger movement is needed , just move your little finger, and you can control the whole field! Predicting the opponent's hidden location, placing your traps and make your moves quickly to kill off the opponents. You can start the game anytime, anywhere, 5 minutes to meet the climax of the game, 10 minutes to play again!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/31ff8b30de4d9dc0fd9fac1222eef7a0.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/31ff8b30de4d9dc0fd9fac1222eef7a0.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/31ff8b30de4d9dc0fd9fac1222eef7a0.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010Friends Playing Tricks, Team Party Doubling the Fun\u3011</h2>Forest pranksters assemble! The correct way to play casual mode is to &quot;set your teammates up&quot;, setting traps and playing gimmicks on each other to the last moment of the match ~ , guarantees easy recreation. While in compete ranking mode, teammates will need to team up, one detect the location opponents' location, and the other throws the pine cone to attack, so that the opponents will have nowhere to hide!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/e1227b1ef0b1af3ee0af38d2a305bc64.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/e1227b1ef0b1af3ee0af38d2a305bc64.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/e1227b1ef0b1af3ee0af38d2a305bc64.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
